@* Exercise 068 - Generic Component Basics (intermediate) - the generic component.
   Goal:   Write a component that renders any type, and a template that receives that
           same type rather than object.
   Drills: @typeparam T, a T-typed parameter, RenderFragment<T?> as a typed template,
           reading the type argument the call site inferred.
   Passes: dotnet test --filter FullyQualifiedName~Ex068_ *@

@* TODO: render exactly one element:
     <span class="badge" data-type="…">…</span>
   where data-type is the NAME of the type argument T (Int32, String, Guid - the
