     - Template applied to Value, when a Template was given;
     - otherwise Value's own text, and nothing at all when Value is null. Careful:
       "T?" on an unconstrained T is a nullability annotation, not Nullable<T>, so a
       value-type T has no null to fall back on - default(Guid) renders as the empty
       Guid, and the tests pin that down rather than hiding it. *@

